  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project incentivises and supports the 38 municipalities of Kosovo in achieving enhanced democratic local governance and better municipal management. It also supports the Government of Kosovo in the development of policies, which are more conducive to rule-based financing of municipalities.</narrative>
